  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Psychosocial Health and Resilience in Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to respond to the intermediate psychosocial and mental health impact of the Ebola Virus Disease (EVD) crisis and to build long-term psychosocial health and resilience at the individual and community levels in project target areas.</narrative>
  </description>
